Cell["\<\
Now that we can obtain UV completions for a given diagram, we just need \
consider all possible permutations of external fields. The function \
MyPermutations[operator] automatically generates all permutations while \
keeping scalars at the beginning of the list.
Example: UV completions for one d=6 BNV SMEFT operator:\
\>", "Text",
