   3.9724843631917562`*^9, {3.972485361485799*^9, 3.972485408344252*^9}, {
   3.972486518140512*^9, 3.9724865364831123`*^9}, 3.972486572488328*^9, 
   3.9725072785152884`*^9, {3.973417332597219*^9, 3.9734173587088957`*^9}, 
   3.973862077440671*^9, 3.973886386647978*^9, 3.982160822572774*^9, 
   3.9825712728568*^9, 3.9843207041602783`*^9, 4.004024692868587*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[75]=",ExpressionUUID->"111b1c91-2975-41ea-a640-417554a81143"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Notice that our CompareUVCompletionsQ function is not very fast, which might \
become an issue when looking at UV completions of d >> 6 operators. Instead \
of working with graphs and IGraph/M, one can instead use the vertex list of \
the topology, say {{6, 7, 8}, {1, 8, 9}, {2, 4, 10}, {3, 5, 11}, {9, 10, \
11}}, to read off charge flow and define a canonical expression, allowing for \
a much faster use of DeleteDuplicatesBy instead of DeleteDuplicates. Please \
contact the authors if that significantly faster code is desired.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972135345412027*^9, 3.972135356199815*^9}, {
   3.97213552717459*^9, 3.972135626101821*^9}, {3.972135671800349*^9, 
   3.972135693831443*^9}, {3.972135742497252*^9, 3.9721358052659607`*^9}, {
   3.972141024526919*^9, 3.972141050046151*^9}, 3.972141997758113*^9, 
   3.9724865825054703`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f6e1e56e-acc4-4748-87b8-\
ed437b2deaca"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "UVCompletion[...] (ran through CompareUVCompletionsQ) now gives us a list \
of UV completions for a given topology and operator. By construction, these \
Feynman diagrams have non-zero vertices and hence give non-zero amplitudes. \
This does NOT mean, unfortunately, that the resulting amplitude can be \
approximated by the non-derivative operator we started out with. To integrate \
out the heavy internal particles at leading order simply corresponds to \
replacing the internal operators by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"1", "/", 
     SuperscriptBox["M", "2"]}], " ", "for", " ", "bosons", " ", "and", " ", 
    RowBox[{"1", "/", "M"}], " ", "for", " ", 
    RowBox[{"fermions", "."}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1d737a90-3f46-4e99-9af6-c8034c7bee0c"],
 " In the resulting amplitude, all external particles are evaluated at the \
same point, and are hence subject to the usual symmetrization and \
anti-symmetrization rules. This is less important for fermions, because they \
come in three distinct generations, but crucial for the external Higgs \
particles, as they come in only one generation. Whenever we UV complete \
operators with two or more H (or two or more anti-H), we need to make sure \
that the resulting amplitude does not vanish in the constant-propagator limit \
due to symmetries, e.g. because it comes out as anti-symmetric under H \
exchange. The next step is then to check UV completions of multi-Higgs \
operators and filter out the UV completions that give a vanishing amplitude \
in the constant-propagator limit (which end up giving non-vanishing \
derivative operators)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972141078104971*^9, 3.972141688896472*^9}, {
  3.9821608700175867`*^9, 
  3.982160870243794*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"944f7b9c-e8a0-46ac-bfac-\
2f0d7eb2e311"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Checking for Higgs asymmetry", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972159336126217*^9, 
  3.972159354932682*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8ce66084-827e-4c5d-869f-\
13ea593aa7a4"],

Cell["\<\
This function takes a UV completion, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]integrates out\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the internal particles using a constant propagator \
by properly contracting the vertex invariants of the diagram, and then checks \
the resulting amplitude for asymmetry in any pair of Higgs fields or \
anti-Higgs fields:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9724845541165953`*^9, 3.9724845945183563`*^9}, {
  3.9724846346383667`*^9, 
  3.972484713759849*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6bc8d620-a899-4a80-9da8-\
5c4395a5b26c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"AsymmetricHiggsQ", "[", "uvcompletion_", "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"topology", ",", "vertex", ",", 
      RowBox[{"vertexfactors", "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "newparticlelabels", ",", 
      "newparticlelabelsbar", ",", "newparticlestates", ",", 
      "newparticlestatesbar", ",", "vertexproduct", ",", "Hlabels", ",", 
      "Hclabels", ",", 
      RowBox[{"totalantisymlist", "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "SMparticlestates", ",", "w", ",", "inv", ",",
       "k", ",", "in", ",", "confirmedNonZero", ",", "trial", ",", "failed", ",",
       "symbolicCheck"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"(*", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"identify", " ", "the", " ", "particle", " ", 
       RowBox[{"label", "/", "name"}], " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Higgses", 
       " ", "and", " ", "anti"}], "-", "Higgses"}], "*)"}], 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Hlabels", "=", 
         RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerString", "[", "#", "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
           
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<H\>\""}], "]"}], 
            "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"Hclabels", "=", 
         RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerString", "[", "#", "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
           
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<Hc\>\""}], "]"}], 
            "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "If", " ", "there", " ", "are", " ", "less", " ", "than", " ", "2", 
           " ", "H", " ", "or", " ", "2", " ", "Hc"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
          "no", " ", "need", " ", "to", " ", "check", " ", "for", " ", 
           "antisymmetry"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"return", " ", "False"}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "Hlabels", "]"}], "<", "2"}], "&&", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "Hclabels", "]"}], "<", "2"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Return", "[", "False", "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "if", " ", "there", " ", "are", " ", "multiple", " ", "Higgses"}], ",",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"need", " ", "to", " ", "calculate", " ", 
           RowBox[{"asymmetry", ":"}]}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"topology", "=", 
         RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "figure", " ", "out", " ", "which", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
           "particles", " ", "are", " ", "internal", " ", "and", " ", "need", 
           " ", "to", " ", "be", " ", "integrated", " ", 
           RowBox[{"out", ".", " ", "we"}], " ", "get", " ", "the", " ", 
           "labels", " ", "of", " ", "all", " ", "new", " ", "particles", " ",
            "from", " ", "topology"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"so", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"p3", ",", "p5", ",", "..."}], "}"}]}]}], "*)"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"newparticlelabels", "=", 
         RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerString", "[", "#", "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
           
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<NB\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<NF\>\""}], "]"}]}],
              "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"and", " ", "we", " ", "also", " ", "get", " ", "p3bar"}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "p5bar", " ", "to", " ", "distinguish", " ", "incoming", " ", "and", 
          " ", "outgoing", " ", "internal", " ", 
          RowBox[{"particles", ":"}]}]}], "*)"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       
       RowBox[{"newparticlelabelsbar", "=", 
        RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", 
             RowBox[{"IntegerString", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", "\"\<bar\>\""}], 
            "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
          RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<NB\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Position", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<NF\>\""}], "]"}]}], 
            "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "run", " ", "over", " ", "all", " ", "the", " ", "vertices", " ", 
          "in", " ", "the", " ", "diagram"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"except", " ", "the", " ", "last", " ", "one"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "and", " ", "calculate", " ", "the", " ", "full", " ", "group", " ", 
          "invariants", " ", "at", " ", "each", " ", "vertex"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "renaming", " ", "the", " ", "multiplets", " ", "by", " ", 
          "particle", " ", "labels", " ", "p1"}], ",", " ", "p2", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "p3", " ", "etc", " ", "that", " ", "match", " ", "the", " ", 
          "labelling", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", 
          RowBox[{"topology", ".", " ", "We"}], " ", "treat", " ", "all", " ",
           "but", " ", "the", " ", "last", " ", "particle", " ", "in", " ", 
          "each", " ", "vertex", " ", "as", " ", "incoming"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "and", " ", "the", " ", "last", " ", "one", " ", "as", " ", 
          "outgoing", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"Conjugations", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "following", " ", "the", " ", "same", " ", "logic", " ", "as", " ", 
           "in", " ", 
           RowBox[{"UVCompletions", ".", " ", "We"}], " ", "distinguish", " ",
            "3", " ", "and", " ", "4"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"particle", " ", 
           RowBox[{"vertices", ":"}]}]}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"For", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"vertex", "=", "1"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"vertex", "<", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
           RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"vertex", "++"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "vertex", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "==", "3"}], ",", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"(*", 
             RowBox[{"3", "-", 
              RowBox[{"particle", " ", "vertex"}]}], "*)"}], 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"inv", "=", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Invariants", "[", 
                RowBox[{"group", ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "/.", "InverseReplaceSMnames"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"Conjugations", "->", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"False", ",", "False", ",", "True"}], "}"}]}], 
                  "}"}]}], "]"}], "/.", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"a", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"b", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"c", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "<>", "\"\<bar\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                RowBox[{"inv", ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<Vanishing vertex! \>\"", ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "vertex", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "inv", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<Non-existing vertex! \>\"", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "vertex", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"vertex", "==", "1"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"(*", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"for", " ", "first", " ", "vertex"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"vertexfactors", " ", "=", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Invariants", "[", "...", "]"}]}]}], "*)"}], 
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"vertexfactors", "=", "inv"}], ";"}], ",", 
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"(*", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                 "for", " ", "all", " ", "subsequent", " ", "vertices"}], ",",
                  " ", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "vertexfactors", " ", "is", " ", "updated", " ", "to", " ", 
                  "a", " ", "nested", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"list", ":", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"inv", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", "vertex1", ")"}], "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"inv", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", "vertex2", ")"}], "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", 
                    "..."}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"inv", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", "vertex1", ")"}], "[", "2", "]"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"inv", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", "vertex2", ")"}], "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", 
                    "..."}], "}"}], " ", "so", " ", "that", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"vertexfactors", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "collects", " ", 
                    "one", " ", "possible", " ", "set", " ", "of", " ", 
                    "diagram", " ", "invariants"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"vertexfactors", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "another"}], ",", 
                    " ", 
                    RowBox[{"etc", "."}]}], " "}]}]}]}], "*)"}], 
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"vertexfactors", "=", 
                 RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "vertexfactors"}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"y", ",", "inv"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "1"}], 
                  "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}], ",", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"(*", 
             RowBox[{"4", "-", 
              RowBox[{"particle", " ", "vertex"}]}], "*)"}], 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"inv", "=", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Invariants", "[", 
                RowBox[{"group", ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"uvcompletion", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "/.", "InverseReplaceSMnames"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"Conjugations", "->", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "False", ",", "False", ",", "False", ",", "True"}], 
                    "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "/.", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"a", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"b", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"c", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"d", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ToExpression", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", 
                    RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"3", ",", "vertex", ",", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                    "]"}], "<>", "\"\<bar\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                RowBox[{"inv", ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<Vanishing vertex! \>\"", ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"topology", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "vertex", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "inv", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
