Cell["\<\
If AsymmetricHiggsQ gives True, the UV completion is not working to get the \
non-derivative operator. (Those are exactly the cases of interest for \
derivative operators though!)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.950535035229537*^9, 3.950535252643444*^9}, {
  3.950535315757442*^9, 3.950535472622594*^9}, {3.950695033541304*^9, 
