Cell["\<\
Okay, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s use this on our previous list of 22 UV \
completions. Turns out 4 of those actually generate derivative operators (at \
mass dimension 10 or 11):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972486614502369*^9, 3.972486675958643*^9}, 
   3.982161207610571*^9},ExpressionUUID->"287410e6-b023-4e46-b1c0-\
28bf105d767b"],

