Cell["\<\
This should be sufficient to work with the provided UV completions. In \
addition, we\[CloseCurlyQuote]re providing significantly stripped down \
versions of UV completions in .dat format, again to be downloaded from \
https://julian-heeck.github.io/BNV/. For example, importing \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]UV_Dim8_1B_1L_T2.dat\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] gives\
\>", "Text",
