522b20cf0d89"],

Cell["\<\
which contains UV completions for all operators with topology T2, stripping \
away the external particles (which are encoded in the operator names \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]O_{8,(1,1)}^{j}\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]) and flipping \
all internal antiparticles to particles, i.e. Sc[3] -> S[3]. This is very \
compact but sufficient for some tasks such as counting how often a new \
particle appears in a given mass dimension. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.984321320099855*^9, 
  3.984321530272917*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"10df08b6-aaf4-4ac6-8b86-\
21ae3395cb58"]
}, Closed]]
}, Open  ]]
},
